# Startup RPMs for every seat. One package name per line.
# Applied to the shared layer (LAYER_MOUNT, host directory PERSIST_ROOT/LAYER_DIR
# in deploy/gs-config.yaml), not to a home directory.
# A name that is already installed is skipped. A name this file used to list,
# and no longer does, is removed on the next boot.
# An optional <layer>/packages.list replaces this file when it is present.
# steam is special-cased: RPM Fusion nonfree is enabled first.
# lutris
# steam
# mangohud
# gamemode
